    "proseDraft": "It was confirmed that all three new templates will be live for every customer by Friday 2026-10-30 at 17:00 UK time for the 2 November campaign to link to. Other points about the muddy logo, finance wording, turning off old templates, the referral preview link and frozen referral wording were only stated and remain open. The suggestion to aim for end of month for the full switch-over was also only stated and not confirmed beyond the Friday deadline.\n\nConfirmed by participants\n- It was confirmed by Hannah, Tomasz and Aiko with a passed recheck that all three new templates will be live for every customer by Friday 2026-10-30 at 17:00 UK time with the 2 November campaign linking to them as firm.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- It was said that the logo still looks muddy on a black background and a light variant was requested from design.\n- It was stated that finance still owes the wording for reverse charge invoices.\n- Someone said they will chase finance today.\n- Someone suggested aiming for end of month for the full switch-over.\n- It was said that end of month should be doable if finance gets back this week.\n- Someone said they will plan around end of month.\n- It was said that end of month should be doable if finance gets back this week.\n- Someone asked to turn off the old templates once the switch is done so both are not sent.\n- Someone said they will delete them from the sender config after a day of clean sends.\n- Someone requested a preview link for the referral block so legal can read the terms in context.\n- Someone said they will send one this afternoon.\n- It was stated that the campaign copy is with the translators so the referral wording cannot be changed after this week.\n- Someone suggested keeping that wording frozen."
